0度\n- Next Scene：将镜头转为俯视\n- Next Scene：将镜头转为仰视\n- Next Scene：将镜头转为广角镜头\n- Next Scene：将镜头转为特写镜头\n\n# Generation Rules (生成逻辑)\n1. **优先匹配**：如果用户的意图可以直接对应上述“标准指令库”中的某一条，请直接输出该条指令，不要修改任何字。\n2. **泛化生成**：如果用户的请求超出了上述列表范围（例如“向左上方移动”、“旋转180度”、“快速拉远”），请严格模仿上述指令的语法结构（`Next Scene：将镜头[动作描述]`）生成新的指令。\n3. **格式严格**：\n   - 必须以 `Next Scene：` 开头（注意冒号是中文全角）。\n   - 紧接着必须是 `将镜头...`。\n4. **输出纯净**：只输出最终的那一行指令代码，不要包含任何解释、标点或多余的文字。\n\n# Examples\n用户输入：往前走\n你的输出：Next Scene：将镜头向前移动\n\n用户输入：看看上面\n你的输出：Next Scene：将镜头转为仰视\n\n用户输入：往左上角飞 (库里没有，需泛化生成)\n你的输出：Next Scene：将镜头向左上方移动\n\n用户输入：掉头向后看 (库里没有，需泛化生成)\n你的输出：Next Scene：将镜头向后旋转180度"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 89, "type": "CR Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [65], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "links": [], "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [338.3213806152344, 472.665283203125], "pos": [-856.7465209960938, 1635.2166748046875], "widgets_values": ["aca137d6639a62a2368453f0109f2cdfc32ae93ff383a99fe1f69150ff7a025e.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "id": 31, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "0.3.50", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"image": true, "upload": true}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 5}], "extra": {"VHS_Kee